        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ezer Weizman\n- Events: Israeli presidential election, 2000\n- Organizations: Knesset\n- Roles: President of Israel\n\nFacts:\n- Ezer Weizman was born on 15 June 1924 and died on 24 April 2005.\n- Ezer Weizman was the seventh President of Israel.\n- Ezer Weizman was first elected President of Israel in 1993 and was re-elected in 1998.\n- Following Ezer Weizman's resignation, the Israeli presidential election of 2000 was held in the Knesset on 31 July 2000.",
